        "info_row_7aga7J": {
          "type": "info_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Ingredients",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Senna </strong>: A stimulant-laxative herb for short-term relief of occasional constipation. Not for daily or prolonged use.</li><li><strong>Psyllium husk: </strong>A fiber-rich botanical that supports stool bulk and bowel regularity; adequate fluid intake is essential.</li><li><strong>Ginger: </strong>Traditionally used to support digestion and ease occasional digestive discomfort.</li><li><strong>Fennel seed : </strong>Traditionally used for gas, bloating and digestive comfort.</li><li><strong>Peppermint: </strong>Provides a cooling aromatic note and supports digestive comfort.</li><li><strong>Rhubarb root: </strong>A traditional cleansing herb that may have laxative effects; supports the short-term positioning.</li></ul>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "info_row_iCgecW": {
          "type": "info_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "content": "<p>Use 1 tablespoon of the loose herbal blend per cup. Add freshly boiled water, cover and steep for 5-10 minutes, then strain. The supplied pack appears to limit use to a few times weekly; confirm the exact maximum frequency against the current approved label before publishing.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "info_row_eCMhKD": {
          "type": "info_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FAQ",
            "content": "<p>• What is ClearPath Detox Herbal Tea?<br/>ClearPath Detox is a premium loose-leaf herbal tea formulated with traditional botanical ingredients commonly used to support digestive wellness and natural cleansing routines.<br/><br/>• What does ClearPath Detox taste like?<br/>ClearPath Detox offers a refreshing herbal flavor with cooling peppermint, warming ginger and aromatic fennel.<br/><br/>• Does this tea contain caffeine?<br/>No. ClearPath Detox is naturally caffeine-free and can be enjoyed any time of day.<br/><br/>• How often should I drink ClearPath Detox?<br/>Many customers enjoy 1–2 cups per week or as needed as part of their digestive wellness and self-care routine.<br/><br/>• Is ClearPath Detox vegan?<br/>Yes. It is made entirely from plant-based ingredients and is suitable for vegan lifestyles.<br/><br/>• Who is this tea for?<br/>ClearPath Detox is ideal for adults seeking a natural herbal tea to support digestive wellness, occasional bloating, and natural detoxification.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
